DESCRIPTION:October Community Service | October 9thThe next community serv
 ice meeting will be on October 9th from 3:45 p.m. to 4:30 p.m. in the Art 
 Room. We will be putting together Happy Kits for Children's Mercy! These k
 its are used in a variety of areas throughout the hospital to make patient
 s and families feel welcome and happy during their visit. Please sign-up u
 sing the link to ensure we have enough supplies for all students attending
 . We are asking each child that comes to bring at least one coloring book 
 to include in the kits if they are able. As a reminder\, we request that a
  parent accompany their child to the meeting and make certain to update PU
 P for that day!https://www.signupgenius.com/go/60B0B4BA8AC2CA31-51725112-o
 teoctober#/
