BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Back to School Night: Session 1
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20250821T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20250821T174000
DTSTAMP:20251106T042046Z
UID:daf5b2cf-86f5-55fa-b2a4-5647f5ba6bda
DESCRIPTION:Overland Trail Elementary Parents and Guardians\,We are excite
 d to welcome you to Back-to-School Night on Thursday\, August21! This impo
 rtant event gives families the opportunity to learn more abouttheir child
 ’s classroom\, curriculum\, and expectations for the upcoming schoolyear
 . Your child’s teacher will present to the group\, sharing key informati
 onto help you support your child’s success and confidently navigate the 
 yearahead\, so you will want to plan to attend one of the two sessions in 
 itsentirety. You'll also hear about opportunities to get involved with the
 Parent-Teacher Organization (PTO) and ways you can contribute to classroom
 events and schoolwide activities. The event will be offered in two session
 s\,and families are asked to select the session that works best for them a
 nd planto attend from start to finish. Session 1 | 5:00 PM-5:40 PM Session
  2 | 5:50 PM-6:30 PMWe look forward to seeing you there and partnering wit
 h you for a strongstart to the school year! Best\,Erica McDonaldPrincipal
  
LOCATION:
END:VEVENT
